n","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_G","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p001:m0305","start":305,"end":306,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_G","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p001:m0313","start":313,"end":316,"surface":"梁元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p001:m0334","start":334,"end":335,"surface":"沖","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete","book_id":"b-chenshu-017","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete-ws1544244"},{"text":"子野少時集注喪服、續裴氏家傳各二卷，抄合後漢事四十餘卷。又敕撰眾僧傳二十卷，百官九品二卷，附益諡法一卷，方國使圖一卷，文集二十卷：並行於世。又欲撰齊梁春秋，始草創，未就而卒。及葬，湘東王為之墓誌銘，陳于藏內。邵陵王又立墓誌，堙於羨道。羨道列志，自此始焉。子騫，官至通直郎。","source_position":{"start":11443,"end":11579,"raw":"子野少時集注喪服、續裴氏家傳各二卷，抄合後漢事四十餘卷。又敕撰眾僧傳二十卷，百官九品二卷，附益諡法一卷，方國使圖一卷，文集二十卷：並行於世。又欲撰齊梁春秋，始草創，未就而卒。及葬，湘東王為之墓誌銘，陳于藏內。邵陵王又立墓誌，堙於羨道。羨道列志，自此始焉。子騫，官至通直郎。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p023","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p023:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p023:m0090","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"湘東王","kind":"person","person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁書卷05固定2312810正文首段明諱繹、天監十三年封湘東郡王；南史此為梁子野中大通二年卒葬時湘東王作誌，時段和唯一王號相合，辨繹，不把外證諱字補進本篇原文。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p023:m0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p023:m0104","start":104,"end":107,"surface":"邵陵王","kind":"person","person_id":"81y_7i5_frc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁書卷29固定1538079正文邵陵攜王綸字世調、天監十三年封、普通五年奪爵後大通元年復封、中大通四年再免；子野中大通二年卒葬時位於復封有效敘事，故本源邵陵王辨綸，不據數位notes或維基百科。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p023:m0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"騫","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野子騫官至通直郎，梁030同父同官同傳末位置作謇，保騫／謇兩來源原字。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-017","source_id":"s-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete-ws1544244","source":{"title":"陳書卷十七·王沖","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1544244","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1544244","revision_id":1544244,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-21","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"陳書卷十七·王沖","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","raw_path":"sources/chenshu/chenshu017-ws1544244.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"8d95f1fe792049025076c024e18aec87f8fd42ac2d05afea063555680e852328"}},{"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233","source":{"title":"南史/卷33","revision_id":1554233,"revision_timestamp":"2019-03-29T02:35:39Z","status":200,"response_sha256":"8380abe50572203e436afe87e646878898cffb422d117948c0f7a802b0086a5a","raw_sha256":"03f36d2b463faf43738af65819a8afae18d17df2da3a2b6e7a824a322b14dc86","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B733&oldid=1554233","api_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=query&format=json&formatversion=2&prop=revisions&rvprop=ids%7Ctimestamp%7Ccontent&rvslots=main&titles=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5